{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21980","headline":"文柏牀 · 白居易","name":"文柏牀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"陵上有老柏，柯叶寒苍苍。\n朝爲风烟树，暮爲宴寝牀。\n以其多奇文，宜升君子堂。\n刮削露节目，拂拭生辉光。\n玄斑状狸首，素质如截肪。\n虽充悦目玩，终乏周身防。\n华彩诚可爱，生理苦已伤。\n方知自残者，爲有好文章。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21980.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21980","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}